  {
   "name": "save_org_context",
   "description": "Stores what the user has said about their business, the onboarding stage reached, an optional decision record, an optional routine, and a note about this session, so a later conversation can continue from it. Partial merge — fields not sent are left unchanged. `stage` accepts one of: new, profile, first_read, first_build, first_enable, routine, done. Some profile fields are server-owned (what is verified, what was activated, the decision log, the first campaign) and are not writable here. Returns `saved`, `refused` and `warnings` describing what the server did with the request.\n\nTools revision: 782ec74d.",
